# AEGIS GRC — Product Requirements Document (PRD)

***

## 1\. Overview

**App Name:** AEGIS GRC — AI-Powered Governance, Risk, and Compliance Platform
**Build Type:** Progressive Web App (PWA)

AEGIS GRC is an AI-powered Governance, Risk, and Compliance (GRC) Progressive Web App designed to help organizations centralize and manage their cybersecurity compliance programs, risk registers, policy documentation, evidence libraries, remediation tasks, and audit readiness workflows within a single unified platform. By replacing fragmented spreadsheets, emails, and disconnected documents, AEGIS GRC provides compliance teams, IT/security professionals, auditors, management, and control owners with a structured, collaborative, and intelligible workspace for managing regulatory and framework obligations including ISO/IEC 27001, SOC 2, NIST CSF, GDPR, India's DPDPA, CERT-In directions, and RBI cybersecurity requirements.

The platform is purpose-built for organizations that need a clear, scalable, and mobile-friendly compliance management experience. Target users include GRC and compliance analysts, IT and cybersecurity teams, internal and external auditors, organizational management, employees acting as control owners, and system administrators. The core problems AEGIS GRC solves are the fragmentation of compliance evidence and activities across multiple tools, the difficulty in tracking control status and ownership, the lack of visibility into audit readiness, and the absence of plain-language guidance to help non-specialist stakeholders understand and act on regulatory requirements.

